      "id": "T02-B2",
      "status": "CONDITIONAL_IF_BUNDLED",
      "finding": "The current workflow uses Node.js 22.23.3 externally and does not bundle Node or npm. npm is installation/build tooling. Its 195-package inventory has license declarations for all entries; seven exact bundled package instances lack colocated license text. Exact npm source evidence and this distinction are recorded in node-npm-closure.json. This is a future bundled-runtime notice item, not an unresolved grant for the current selected application dependencies."
    },
    {
      "id": "T02-B3",
      "status": "CONDITIONAL_IF_BUNDLED",
      "finding": "Temurin JDK 21.0.12.1+1 Linux x64 is selected as an externally installed build/runtime prerequisite and is not bundled by this project. Exact archive checksum, full source commit, and hashes of all 38 legal files are recorded. If a later distribution includes the JDK, preserve those legal files and meet GPL-2.0 with Classpath Exception requirements, including applicable source availability."
    },
    {
      "id": "T02-B4",
      "status": "EVIDENCED",
      "finding": "The exact assembled helper JAR contains META-INF/LICENSE, META-INF/LICENSE.txt, and META-INF/NOTICE. Each of the three runtime artifacts has an evidenced Apache-2.0 grant and the corresponding embedded/source license material; checksums and evidence are recorded in parser_runtime.runtime_closure."
    },
    {
      "id": "T02-B5",
      "status": "OWNER_DECISION",
      "finding": "The independent product license remains PENDING_OWNER_DECISION, as recorded in docs/product/license-and-naming.md. No conclusion about the product license is made here."
    }
  ],
